   "statement": {
    "desc": [
     "给定行数 `numRows`，生成杨辉三角的前 `numRows` 行。在杨辉三角中，每个数是它**左上方和上方**的数的和。"
    ],
    "examples": [
     {
      "input": "numRows = 5",
      "output": "[[1],[1,1],[1,2,1],[1,3,3,1],[1,4,6,4,1]]"
     },
     {
      "input": "numRows = 1",
      "output": "[[1]]"
     }
    ],
    "constraints": [
     "1 <= numRows <= 30"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "每行两端是 1，中间 `row[j] = prev[j-1] + prev[j]`——上一行就是现成的状态。",
     "逐行构造即可，无需任何搜索。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "第 1 行 [1]",
     "每行首尾置 1",
     "中间位 = 上一行相邻两数之和",
     "重复 numRows 行"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(n²)",
     "space": "O(1)（不计输出）"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def generate(self, numRows: int) -> List[List[int]]:\n        res = []\n        for i in range(numRows):\n            row = [1] * (i + 1)\n            for j in range(1, i):        # 中间位 = 上一行相邻之和\n                row[j] = res[i - 1][j - 1] + res[i - 1][j]\n            res.append(row)\n        return res"
   },
