     "1 <= wordDict.length <= 1000",
     "wordDict 中所有字符串互不相同"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "`dp[i]` = s 的前 i 个字符能否被拆分。转移：存在 j < i 使 `dp[j]` 为真且 `s[j:i]` 在字典里。",
     "dp[0] = true（空串是基准）。把「拼接」反过来想：最后一个单词占掉 s[j:i]，剩下前缀 dp[j] 必须可拆。",
     "枚举单词长度可加速；配合字典树可做到接近 O(n·最长词)。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "`dp[0] = true`",
     "i 从 1 到 n：枚举分割点 j",
     "`dp[i] = OR( dp[j] && s[j:i] ∈ dict )`",
     "返回 dp[n]"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(n²)（可优化）",
     "space": "O(n)"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def wordBreak(self, s: str, wordDict: List[str]) -> bool:\n        words = set(wordDict)\n        n = len(s)\n        dp = [False] * (n + 1)\n        dp[0] = True                       # 空串可拆\n        for i in range(1, n + 1):\n            for j in range(i):             # 最后一个单词 = s[j:i]\n                if dp[j] and s[j:i] in words:\n                    dp[i] = True\n                    break\n        return dp[n]"
   },
