   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "`dp[i]` = 以 nums[i] **结尾**的 LIS 长度：看所有比它小的前驱 `dp[j]+1` 取最大，没有前驱则 1。",
     "注意「严格递增」：相等不算前驱。",
     "进阶 O(n log n)：维护 tails 数组（长度 k 的递增子序列最小结尾），对每个数二分替换 —— tails 长度即答案。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "`dp[i]` = 以 nums[i] 结尾的 LIS 长度",
     "遍历 j < i 且 nums[j] < nums[i]：dp[i] = max(dp[j] + 1)",
     "无前驱则 dp[i] = 1",
     "答案 = max(dp)"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(n²)（二分优化 O(n log n)）",
     "space": "O(n)"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def lengthOfLIS(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:\n        n = len(nums)\n        dp = [1] * n\n        for i in range(1, n):\n            for j in range(i):\n                if nums[j] < nums[i]:\n                    dp[i] = max(dp[i], dp[j] + 1)\n        return max(dp)"
   },
