      "input": "nums = [2,3,-2,4]",
      "output": "6（[2,3]）"
     },
     {
      "input": "nums = [-2,0,-1]",
      "output": "0"
     }
    ],
    "constraints": [
     "1 <= nums.length <= 2 × 10⁴",
     "-10 <= nums[i] <= 10",
     "任何子数组的乘积都在 32 位整数范围内"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "乘法的陷阱：一个很小的（负）最大值乘上负数会**翻转成最大值**。所以同时维护「以 i 结尾的最大积 `f`」和「最小积 `g`」。",
     "转移：`f = max(x, f·x, g·x)`；`g = min(x, f'·x, g·x)`（注意用更新前的 f！）。答案 = 历史最大的 f。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "同时维护以 i 结尾的最大积与最小积",
     "`f = max(x, f_prev·x, g_prev·x)`",
     "`g = min(x, f_prev·x, g_prev·x)`",
     "答案 = max(所有 f)"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(n)",
     "space": "O(1)"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def maxProduct(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:\n        f = g = ans = nums[0]      # 以 i 结尾的最大积 / 最小积\n        for x in nums[1:]:\n            cands = (x, f * x, g * x)\n            f, g = max(cands), min(cands)\n            ans = max(ans, f)\n        return ans"
   },
