   ],
   "statement": {
    "desc": [
     "给你一个只包含 `'('` 和 `')'` 的字符串，找出最长的**格式正确且连续**的有效括号子串的长度。"
    ],
    "examples": [
     {
      "input": "s = \"()()())\"",
      "output": "4（\"()()\"）"
     },
     {
      "input": "s = \")(()())\"",
      "output": "6"
     }
    ],
    "constraints": [
     "0 <= s.length <= 3 × 10⁴",
     "s[i] 为 '(' 或 ')'"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "`dp[i]` = 以 i 结尾的最长有效括号长度（s[i] 必须是 ')' 才可能 > 0）：",
     "情形 A：`s[i-1]=='('` → `dp[i] = dp[i-2] + 2`（...() 直接拼上）；",
     "情形 B：`s[i-1]==')'` 且 `s[i-dp[i-1]-1]=='('` → 与更前面的有效段拼接：`dp[i] = dp[i-1] + 2 + dp[i-dp[i-1]-2]`。",
     "dp 数组天然处理了「连续」要求 —— 断点处 dp=0。栈与正反向计数是另外两种解法。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "`dp[i]` = 以 i 结尾的最长有效括号长",
     "s[i]==')' 且 s[i-1]=='('：dp[i] = dp[i-2] + 2",
     "否则若 s[i-1]==')' 且前面隔着一段有效后还有 '('：dp[i] = dp[i-1] + 2 + dp[i-dp[i-1]-2]",
     "答案 = max(dp)"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(n)",
     "space": "O(n)"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def longestValidParentheses(self, s: str) -> int:\n        n = len(s)\n        dp = [0] * n                  # 以 i 结尾的最长有效长度\n        ans = 0\n        for i in range(1, n):\n            if s[i] == \")\":\n                if s[i - 1] == \"(\":    # 情形 A：...()\n                    dp[i] = (dp[i - 2] if i >= 2 else 0) + 2\n                elif (j := i - dp[i - 1] - 1) >= 0 and s[j] == \"(\":\n                    dp[i] = dp[i - 1] + 2 + (dp[j - 1] if j >= 1 else 0)\n                ans = max(ans, dp[i])\n        return ans"
   },
